WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.715 --> 00:00:02.840
PRIYANKA VERGADIA: Every
week on Google Cloud Labs,

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.270
we discuss a different
lab and go over

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.720
what you would learn
when you take a lab.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:11.560
But what is Qwiklabs, and how
can it be helpful for you?

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:14.610
A Qwiklab is an online
learning environment

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:17.250
along with a set of
instructions to walk you

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.760
through a live, real-world,
and scenario-based use

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:24.740
case without needing
an account on GCP.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.980
In a lab, you will have access
to the actual environment

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.420
you want to learn about--

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.180
not a simulation or
demo environment.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:33.860
You can access the
lab environment

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:37.740
from anywhere on the internet
using a standard browser.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:41.030
So how do you take a lab?

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:44.420
First, get started by
either creating an account

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.360
or signing in.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.030
Find labs by browsing
the Qwiklabs Quest

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:52.960
or clicking on the Lab
Catalog and then the Lab tab.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:57.460
The Lab tab lets you scroll
through all the available labs.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.290
Read more about
a lab by clicking

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:01.490
on the lab of your choice.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.810
The Lab page opens
to the Lab menu page.

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:08.080
The timer located next
to the Start Lab button

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.930
shows the total time
that resources will be

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:13.840
made available to take the lab.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.980
The lab will end after the
timer finishes counting down.

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:21.610
To begin a lab, click
the Start Lab button.

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:25.180
The lab will not start until
you have selected the Start Lab

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.940
button and entered the
appropriate credits

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.220
or token code.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:33.640
The cost of the lab is
indicated in credits.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:36.820
Some labs are free and
require no credits.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.210
Each dollar spent
buys one credit.

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:43.660
Labs vary in number
of credits required.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.410
When you are finished with the
lab, click the End Lab button

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:50.490
and leave a review.

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:54.595
You'll notice something else in
Qwiklabs, and that is quests.

00:01:54.595 --> 00:01:57.700
Qwiklab Quests are introductory
and advanced learning pads

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:01.600
that consist of collection of
labs organized by technologies,

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.650
specific cloud services,
and practical use cases.

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:09.340
Completion of the required labs
that are part of Qwiklabs Quest

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.530
will earn you badges
that recognize

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.840
your hands-on experience.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.805
Your Qwiklabs Quest
badges will be

00:02:15.805 --> 00:02:19.510
a permanent part of your
Qwiklabs account and profile.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:21.670
Referencing your
accomplishments can be

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.860
a positive mark of distinction.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:27.520
You're encouraged to share your
achievements on social media.

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.770
For example, you can
do this by adding

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:33.550
a link on your LinkedIn
profile pointing to your badge.

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:35.830
There are many labs on Qwiklabs.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.950
Let us know in comments below
which one you are taking

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.780
and how it went.

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:42.310
Thank you for
watching, and whenever

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:44.500
you are ready to sign
up, we are giving you

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.050
a $300 credit for GCP.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.240
Just click on the link
in the description below.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.990
[MUSIC PLAYING]

